  "package_id": "ellipsoid-witness-optimality",
  "formal_scope": "Lean 4.19.0 proves, for genuine complex 4×4 matrices with states ranging over all complex density matrices and block positivity over all complex product vectors, that W_{1/4}, W_{3/4} and, for every 0 < p < 1/2, W_p and W_{1−p} are Class D witnesses with equal canonical ellipsoids, that W_{1−p} is strictly finer and that W_p is optimal in no set containing W_{1−p}; also the exact detection and geometric orders of the family, a noncanonical Class C comparison, normal-form remainder certificates, the sharp mirror interval, soundness of the containment LMI and product-vector existence. A strict audit covers all 623 project declarations. Necessity and the chirality characterization for arbitrary targets are conventional proofs using the published two-qubit decomposability and Lorentz normal-form theorems; the Lean assembly of the classification takes cofinality, incomparability and faithfulness as explicit hypotheses, and the finite identities are checked by exact SymPy scripts.",
